title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf trash prune
catalog: CLI command
target: mf trash prune
summary: Permanently delete trashed files (by size, age, or all)

!! Reference

```
Permanently delete trashed files (by size, age, or all)

Usage: mf trash prune [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -s, --size <SIZE>
          Delete oldest-first until the total is under this size (e.g. 100mb, 1g)

  -d, --older-than <OLDER_THAN>
          Delete entries older than this duration (e.g. 1y, 30d, 12h)

      --all
          Empty the trash

      --dry-run
          Show what would be removed without deleting anything

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
